                "text": "Last week, I met with @BeTheMatch to discuss the importance of bone marrow transplants. I know from personal experience that these transplants save lives, and I was glad to see these two Ohioans working to get patients around the world the life-saving treatment they need. https://t.co/ZbuLMvyc7U",
