                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Despite years of work in Congress to negotiate balanced and bipartisan patient protections from surprise medical bills, agency bureaucrats continue to implement the No Surprises Act, counter to the law, in a way that harms patients, restricts access to care, and has financially strained medical providers across the country. \n\nI outlined these issues during a Ways and Means Committee hearing this week, watch here:",
