                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I visited the Hocking Valley Community Hospital for a tour of their urgent care, clinical, and outpatient facilities with CEO Stacey Gabriel. \n\nCritical Access Hospitals are vital to providing care for our rural communities and I will continue to be a voice for them in Washington to ensure that we are addressing the unique challenges they face.",
