                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to see the Lower Costs, More Transparency Act, H.R. 5378, pass in the house this week. This bipartisan bill puts patients at the center of their health care by ensuring they have timely and accurate information on the cost of services and medication. The bill also supports community health centers, which are vital to serving rural communities.",
