                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to see key health care provisions from two of my bills included in H.R. 8261, the Preserving Telehealth, Hospital, and Ambulance Access Act, reported favorably today out of @WaysandMeansGOP.\n\nAs a physician, I know that many patients heal better in the comforts of their own homes. By extending these critical provisions, we can ensure that patients, especially those in rural and underserved areas, have access to the care that best fits their needs. \n\nWatch my full remarks \ud83d\udc47",
