                "text": "Medicare patients should not have to wait years to access FDA approved technological advancements. I'm glad my bill as amended, the Ensuring Patient Access to Critical Breakthrough Products Act, H.R. 1619, advanced out of @WaysandMeansGOP in an overwhelming bipartisan vote. Watch my remarks \ud83d\udc47",
