                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I believe that as physicians, we must focus on ensuring high-quality care for our patients across their entire lives. The worrisome expansion of physician-assisted suicide moves us away from both our values and our role as physicians to \"first, do no harm.\" I will always stand strong for the sanctity of life.",
