                "retweet_count": 18,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, the House passed my bill, the Chronic Disease Flexible Coverage Act, to expand coverage of preventative care for chronic conditions under high-deductible health plans. \n\nBy expanding access, we can work towards making America the healthiest nation on the planet while reducing the price of care in the future. Watch my remarks \ud83d\udc47",
